	optdepends = bluez-utils: bluetoothctl, the Bluetooth pairing agent that answers pairing prompts
	optdepends = snapper: a snapshot before the update pipeline changes packages
	optdepends = timeshift: a snapshot before the update pipeline changes packages, without snapper
	optdepends = sudo: package installs and the browser policy writer in floating TUIs
	optdepends = nvidia-utils: verifies a selected Jarvis CUDA local voice tier
	optdepends = ddcutil: brightness of external displays in the Displays plugin
	optdepends = brightnessctl: brightness of a laptop built-in display in the Displays plugin
	optdepends = cronie: crontab, which schedules automations where no systemd user manager answers
	optdepends = greetd: the login screen at boot
	optdepends = uwsm: the Hyprland (uwsm-managed) session the login screen starts first
	optdepends = xorg-xinit: startx, for X11 sessions on the login screen
	optdepends = glibc: getent, the accounts on the login screen
	optdepends = polkit: pkexec, so applications can ask for administrator access
	optdepends = tailscale: the Tailscale connection in the VPN plugin
